{"hw":"δραχμή","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">δραχμή</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">δραχμ-ή</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, (<span class=\"gk\">δράσσομαι,</span> prop. <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">as much as one can hold in the hand,</b> cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lys.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">17</span> </span>): </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">I</span> a weight, <b class=\"lex-tr\">drachm,</b> [<span class=\"gk\">κρεῶν</span>] prob.in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.10.4</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Thphr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Od.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">17</span> </span>, etc. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> a silver coin, <b class=\"lex-tr\">drachma,</b> worth six obols, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.144</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">And.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.18</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.3171.52</span> </span> (Orchom. <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Boeot.</span> </span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9(1).694.54</span> </span> (Corc.), etc. [The penult. is long in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Simon.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">157</span> </span>, and sts. in Com., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">V.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">691</span> </span> (anap.), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pax</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1201</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pl.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1019</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.Com.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">174.17</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">δαρχμή</span> is found in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span>; cf. <span class=\"gk\">δαρκνά.</span>]</div></div>"}